#: packages/wallet/src/screens/About.tsx
msgctxt "about.crash.hint"
msgid "Off by default, and only to ElectroSwap. A crash sends the message and stack, with addresses, secrets and URLs scrubbed. A swap that fails also sends the trade, the route and — so the failure can be reproduced — your address and the balances it involved. Never a signature, and never when you simply decline a sheet."
