msgid "Farms: the ring hums brighter as DYNO accrues, dates are engraved on the ring, and Collect discharges the coil into the readout while the DYNO bar rolls. Acceptance: the multiplier and the date to 2.5× are readable at a glance; nothing twitches per block except the pending-reward digits."
