#: packages/wallet/src/screens/Moments.tsx
msgctxt "moments.criterion.legends"
msgid "Electric Legends dividends: claimable ETN rises as liquid light in a glass vessel between claims; Claim drains it into the readout. Acceptance: a holder understands \"marketplace fees are paying me\" from the plate alone; the vessel never animates when nothing has changed."
msgstr "Electric Legends dividends: claimable ETN rises as liquid light in a glass vessel between claims; Claim drains it into the readout. Acceptance: a holder understands \"marketplace fees are paying me\" from the plate alone; the vessel never animates when nothing has changed."

#: packages/wallet/src/screens/Moments.tsx
msgctxt "moments.criterion.qr"
