msgstr "Receive on mobile: the QR reads as etched into glass with gyroscope parallax on the light across it (Reanimated + device motion), static on web; it must scan first time at 30 cm."

#: packages/wallet/src/screens/Moments.tsx
msgctxt "moments.criterion.rack"
msgid "Collectibles: pieces sit on glass shelves with depth, contact shadows and a specular edge from the Field; opening a piece is a shared-element move into a view where the artwork is lit by a single slow light sweep; buying a piece lands it on your shelf with a Discharge. Acceptance: a first-time viewer can tell which pieces are listed and which have offers without reading text."
msgstr "Collectibles: pieces sit on glass shelves with depth, contact shadows and a specular edge from the Field; opening a piece is a shared-element move into a view where the artwork is lit by a single slow light sweep; buying a piece lands it on your shelf with a Discharge. Acceptance: a first-time viewer can tell which pieces are listed and which have offers without reading text."

